<title>PHILIPPINES: Zipporah price rise halted after surge.</title>
<headline>Zipporah price rise halted after surge.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange had halted a further rise in the share price of Zipporah Realty after it rose by 49.02 percent on Monday, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>Zipporah rose to 19 pesos from its previous close of 12.75 pesos with 324,000 shares being traded.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Raoul Angangco told the bourse that the company was unaware of any information which should affect the value of its shares.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
